{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🚀Just_1_min🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🚀Just 1 min🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_The_Learning_Royal\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by The Learning Royal</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEMbreezy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEMbreezy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Four friends do yardwork for their neighbors over the weekend, earning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40e538d1a5fbfc50942e89baa7a50351eaad7aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$15, \\$20, \\$25,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b47f2b1eb372398a82c21d9e7575e136e4d8ee0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$40,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"34\" height=\"19\" /> respectively. They decide to split their earnings equally among themselves. In total, how much will the friend who earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7a6304da716110d548a4dc8944c3d41eae0f38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> give to the others?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c739ad35f236329630cec971937f1e5c9332b6fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\$5 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\$10 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\$15 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\$20 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"437\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The friends earn <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fad600e47264802302ef4650d99b818b4fbbf00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\\left(15+20+25+40\\right)=\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"228\" height=\"20\" /> in total. Since they decided to split their earnings equally, it follows that each person will get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecb12fa32076668a1d9bcf42c5e87305891f1c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\\left(\\frac{100}{4}\\right)=\\$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"123\" height=\"45\" />. Since the friend who earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7a6304da716110d548a4dc8944c3d41eae0f38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> will need to leave with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbe8755ab50447cac8dac1ef464e9d4034f110d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />, he will have to give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/4/b7441b4c692634ed810a794490c5f0c4a685b7bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\\left(40-25\\right)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }\\$15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"184\" height=\"31\" /> to the others.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The friends earn <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fad600e47264802302ef4650d99b818b4fbbf00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\\left(15+20+25+40\\right)=\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"228\" height=\"20\" /> in total. Since they decided to split their earnings equally, it follows that each person will get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecb12fa32076668a1d9bcf42c5e87305891f1c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\\left(\\frac{100}{4}\\right)=\\$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"123\" height=\"45\" />. The friend who earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> will not distribute anything, the friend that earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> needs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and the friend that earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> needs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f4afbb7dbc2e34da654ead3afe88a00fc2dbb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 + 5 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"14\" />, therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/4/b7441b4c692634ed810a794490c5f0c4a685b7bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\\left(40-25\\right)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }\\$15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"184\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hgK6rESdek&amp;t=9s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hgK6rESdek&amp;t=9s</a>\n</p><p>~NiuniuMaths\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=UKNnVW0qEuIdyt8u&amp;t=229\">https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=UKNnVW0qEuIdyt8u&amp;t=229</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.9A.80Just_1_min.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🚀Just_1_min🚀)\">Video Solution (🚀Just 1 min🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🚀Just 1 min🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CC5jRJ95QB0\">https://youtu.be/CC5jRJ95QB0</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-mSgttsOv2Y\">https://youtu.be/-mSgttsOv2Y</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Learning_Royal\">Video Solution by The Learning Royal</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by The Learning Royal\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/eSxzI8P9_h8\">https://youtu.be/eSxzI8P9_h8</a>\n</p><p>~The Learning Royal\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=62\">https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=62</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZwfPEYd55NQ\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZwfPEYd55NQ</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEMbreezy\">Video Solution by STEMbreezy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEMbreezy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/L_vDc-i585o?list=PLFcinOE4FNL0TkI-_yKVEYyA_QCS9mBNS&amp;t=37\">https://youtu.be/L_vDc-i585o?list=PLFcinOE4FNL0TkI-_yKVEYyA_QCS9mBNS&amp;t=37</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mGQw1yALXYM&amp;t=113s\">https://youtu.be/mGQw1yALXYM&amp;t=113s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8\" title=\"2020 AMC 8\">2020 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title